      "text": "Frequency once per day\n\nTrigger Another creature critically succeeds at a check\n\n---\nEffect The name collector honors the achievement with a new name. The creature gets a +1 status bonus on the same check until their next daily preparations. They become temporarily immune for 1 month.",
